                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God will raise up for you a prophet like me from among you, from your brethren—him you shall heed— ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "just as you desired of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God at Horeb on the day of the assembly, when you said, ‘Let me not hear again the voice of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " my God, or see this great fire any more, lest I die.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, ‘They have rightly said all that they have spoken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will raise up for them a prophet like you from among their brethren; and I will put my words in his mouth, and he shall speak to them all that I command him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And whoever will not give heed to my words which he shall speak in my name, I myself will require it of him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the prophet who presumes to speak a word in my name which I have not commanded him to speak, or who speaks in the name of other gods, that same prophet shall die.’ ",
          "type": "text",
